<rml>
<head>
	<!-- The costume preview popup (NOVA-202; legacy uicostumepreview.py
	     CostumePreview). Holding the preview key (the "show names" action, Alt
	     by default) over a costume in a shop, the exchange, the cube or the
	     shop search shows the player's own model wearing it: the model preview
	     "costume" (CPythonModelPreview, drawn into the view model-costume)
	     over the costume's name. costume_preview.py decides when it shows and
	     where (beside the item tooltip); controller
	     assets/root/nui_costume_preview.py. A tooltip-like board: it takes no
	     pointer and no focus. -->
	<title>costume-preview</title>
	<link type="text/template" href="../../nui.rtpl"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="costume-preview.rcss"/>
</head>
<body template="nui" id="costume-preview" class="nui-board nui-board--tooltip nui-fx cpv" data-model="costume_preview">
	<div class="cpv__well"><nui-view id="cpv-view" class="cpv__view" name="model-costume" hover="none"></nui-view></div>
	<span id="cpv-name" class="cpv__name">{{ name }}</span>
</body>
</rml>
